{
  "label": "Watch Value & Import/Export",
  "category": "Watch-List",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Manajemen Nilai (Watch Value)",
      "id": "watch-value",
      "intro": "Klik tombol **Review Details** dari Detail Panel untuk membuka jendela penuh (full-screen drawer) dengan tiga tab: **Watch Value**, **Import**, dan **Export**. Di sinilah Anda mengelola nilai-nilai aktual yang tersimpan di dalam sebuah Watch List.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Tab Watch Value — Dataset Nilai",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Menampilkan seluruh nilai individual (*values*) dalam tabel bertitle **Watch Value Dataset**.\n• Setiap baris menampilkan kolom **Registry Value** — berisi nilai aktual (misal: `192.168.10.55`) beserta ID singkat (`ID: #xxxxxxxx`).\n• Toolbar aksi memiliki empat tombol:\n  - **Search Registry** — membuka panel pencarian Watch Value di sisi kanan.\n  - **Add New Record** — membuka form *Create Watch Value*.\n  - **Edit Entry** — mengubah nilai yang terpilih (aktif setelah ada seleksi).\n  - **Decommission Record** — menghapus nilai yang terpilih (aktif setelah ada seleksi).\n• Klik sebuah baris untuk memilihnya dan membuka **Detail Panel** di sebelah kanan.\n• Default tampilan: **Table View**.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:380px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#f59e0b;border-bottom:2px solid #f59e0b;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Watch Value</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Import</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Export</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Watch Value Dataset</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">🔍 Search Registry</div><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#10b981;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add New Record</div><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;\">Edit Entry</div><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;\">Decommission</div></div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:7px 12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">Registry Value</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #f8fafc;background:#fffbeb;border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;\"><div style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">192.168.10.55</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">ID: #a3f8c012</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #f8fafc;\"><div style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#94a3b8;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;\">10.0.0.254</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">ID: #b9e1247a</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#94a3b8;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;\">172.16.0.1</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">ID: #cc291a88</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Add / Edit Watch Value",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Add New Record** untuk membuat nilai baru, atau pilih sebuah baris lalu klik **Edit Entry** untuk mengubahnya.\n• Form muncul sebagai **drawer** di sisi kanan layar dengan judul **Create Watch Value** atau **Edit Watch Value**.\n• Form ini hanya memiliki **satu field wajib**: `Value` — isi dengan nilai yang ingin didaftarkan (misal: alamat IP `203.0.113.42`, nomor BIN `455000`, atau nilai teks lainnya).\n• Tombol footer: **Cancel** dan **Create** / **Update**.\n• Setelah berhasil disimpan, baris baru akan langsung muncul di tabel **Watch Value Dataset**.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><div style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:#10b981;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Watch Value</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Fill details and save changes</div></div></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">● Add</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:10px;\">Watch Value Information</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Value <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;background:#f0fdf4;\">203.0.113.42</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px;\">e.g. IP address, BIN number, account number</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#10b981;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Search Registry — Pencarian Watch Value",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Search Registry** di toolbar untuk membuka panel pencarian Watch Value di sisi kanan layar.\n• Panel berjudul **Search Watch Value** dengan subtitle *Set filters and apply*.\n• Hanya terdapat **satu filter**: `Value` — cari berdasarkan nilai yang tersimpan (sebagian atau lengkap).\n• Tombol **Reset** menghapus filter dan menampilkan ulang semua data, tombol **Apply Filters** menjalankan pencarian.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:240px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;background:#f8fafc;\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Search Watch Value</div><span style=\"padding:2px 7px;border-radius:12px;background:#dbeafe;border:1px solid #93c5fd;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#1d4ed8;\">● Search</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:3px;\">Set filters and apply</div></div><div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#64748b;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;\"></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Value</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/></svg>Enter value...</div></div></div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;\"></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Reset</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#3b82f6;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Apply Filters</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Tab Import — Ingesti Data Massal",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Gunakan tab **Import** untuk mengunggah ribuan nilai sekaligus tanpa input manual satu per satu.\n• Area utama menampilkan **Dropzone** dengan label **Acquire Value Manifest** — seret dan lepas file ke area ini.\n• Format yang didukung: **CSV** (`.csv`) dan **JSON** (`.json`). Ukuran file maksimum: **25 MB**.\n• Setelah file di-drop, sistem menganalisis file dan menampilkan panel **Verification Center** — daftar semua nilai yang terdeteksi, siap untuk diverifikasi.\n• Centang nilai yang ingin diimport (atau klik **Select Visible**), lalu klik **Finalize Import (n)** untuk menyelesaikan proses ingesti.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:360px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Watch Value</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#6366f1;border-bottom:2px solid #6366f1;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Import</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Export</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Import Watch Value</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">Verify and ingest new value entries into the registry</div></div><div style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;\">⬆ Finalize Import</div></div><div style=\"border:2px dashed #6366f1;border-radius:10px;padding:22px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef2ff,#e0e7ff);\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 10px;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"17 8 12 3 7 8\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"15\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#312e81;\">Acquire Value Manifest</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:4px;\">Drag & drop your CSV or JSON file here</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#6366f1;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">.csv</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#6366f1;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">.json</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Max 25MB</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Tab Export — Ekstraksi Data ke CSV",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tab **Export** digunakan untuk mengunduh Watch Values yang terdaftar ke file lokal.\n• Halaman terbagi dua panel:\n  - **Packaging Details** (sidebar kiri, 320px): menampilkan metadata *Source Registry*, *Registry Units*, *Selection Target*, dan *Extraction Date*.\n  - **Selection Source** (panel kanan): menampilkan seluruh Watch Values dengan checkbox — pilih mana yang ingin diekspor.\n• Centang nilai yang diinginkan (atau klik **Select All** / **Deselect All**), lalu klik **Finalize Export (n)** di toolbar atas.\n• File hasil unduhan berformat **CSV** dengan nama `watch_value - [timestamp].csv` dan langsung tersimpan ke folder unduhan lokal.",
          "color": "#0ea5e9",
          "bg": "#f0f9ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:360px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Watch Value</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Import</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0ea5e9;border-bottom:2px solid #0ea5e9;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Export</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Export Watch Value</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">Package and extract selected values from the registry</div></div><div style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#0ea5e9;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">↑ Finalize Export (2)</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"width:110px;min-width:110px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Packaging Details</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Source</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">High-Risk IPs</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Units</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">124</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Selected</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0ea5e9;\">2</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Format</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">CSV</span></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#10b981;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#10b981;font-weight:600;\">Verified</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">Selection Source</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0ea5e9;\">Select All</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border-bottom:1px solid #f8fafc;background:#f0f9ff;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:#0ea5e9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">192.168.10.55</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border-bottom:1px solid #f8fafc;background:#f0f9ff;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:#0ea5e9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">10.0.0.254</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">172.16.0.1</span></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
